  "description": "One hundred years after the defeat of the Twilight Witch, the Aurum Empire's \"witch of the old castle,\" Vivian Dampierre, is accused of killing her adopted younger sister Charlotte. But just as the rebellion kills her trusted knight Ian and threatens to burn her at the stake, Vivian is transported three years back in time by the mysterious Twilight Witch. With this second chance, will Vivian survive to uncover the Twilight Witch's secret identity and turn the wheel of fate once more? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes one prologue chapter.*",
